graph TD
  A[Push / Manual Trigger] --> B[GitHub Action]

  B --> C[Checkout repo]

  C --> D[Upload sources to Crowdin]

  D --> E[Crowdin translation happens asynchronously]

  E --> F[Download available translations]

  F --> G[Update l10n branch]

  G --> H[Create PR to main]

  H --> I[Human review]
